{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52159","headline":"五言後池侍宴回文诗一首应诏 · 许敬宗","name":"五言後池侍宴回文诗一首应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉气澄佳序，碧沚澹遥空。\n篁林下仪凤，彩鷁间宾鸿。\n苍山带落日，丽苑扇薰风。\n长筵列广醼，庆洽载恩隆。\n（同前）（按：本诗原署与前诗同。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}